# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Database lokal & dump
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Skema WAJIB dibangun dari migrasi, bukan dari dump yang di-restore manual
#  (brief §7.2 butir 4). Dump tidak perlu masuk repo.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.sql.gz
dump.sql
backup*.sql
pgdata/
postgres-data/
mysql-data/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Log & artefak runtime
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/
.cache/
pids/
*.pid
*.seed

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Editor & IDE
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json.example
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.fleet/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.history/
*.code-workspace

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Sistem operasi
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Artefak tool AI & catatan pribadi
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Catatan: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, dan berkas aturan agent lainnya WAJIB
#  di-commit — jangan pernah menambahkannya ke daftar ini.
#  Yang diabaikan hanyalah cache/sesi lokal tool.
.aider*
.claude/
.cursor/cache/
.continue/
.copilot/
*.local.md
catatan-pribadi*.md
